# TIN TROOP 3-A, start to finish with plain button presses (recorded once
# from a route plan). A seed from the pot makes the first soldier glow; he
# waits at the foot of the flour bin and becomes a vine to its top. The
# second climbs it, collects the prizes, lets the next pot seed him and
# becomes a vine by the bread bin, which the third climbs.
game tintroop
wait 5
cheat unlock
press A
wait 5
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 5
wait 129
hold RIGHT 108
hold RIGHT+A 20
hold RIGHT 85
